The first build attempt stopped safely before weighting or saving: Blender’s face-selection state did not produce a pure plate object, and an assertion caught it. I also found the selection loop was accidentally rebuilding a 102,573-entry set for every face, explaining the long runtime. I’m correcting both issues, then rerunning from the untouched I03 source.
