Face-only separation now passes exactly, but Blender’s heat solver cannot process all 1,608 disconnected soft regions in one object and returned zero weights; the script stopped before saving. I’m keeping the final soft body as one object, while running the same automatic heat operator component-by-component on temporary soft-only meshes and using the established nearest-weighted fallback only for components the solver cannot resolve.
