The failure data revealed a real implementation defect before I finalize the report: Blender’s face separation left loose boundary edges/vertices in both outputs. Those non-rendering remnants were included in the stretch graph and also collapsed the expected island count. The brief requires disconnected mesh regions, so I’m removing only geometry referenced by no face, rebuilding from I03, and rerunning the gate.
apply patch
